S_0 = 2S_2
\]

Now solve for \( S_2 \):
\[
S_2 = \frac{S_0}{2} = \frac{S_0}{2} = \frac{S_1 + S_0}{2}
\]

Using \( S_1 + S_0 = S_3 \):
