\]

Next, isolate \( pq \):
\[
q(p + 256) = 2560
\]

Divide through by \( p \):
\[
q = \frac{2560}{p}
\]

Thus, the pairs \( (p, q) \) satisfying the conditions are:
\[
\boxed{(p, q) = (256, 2560)}
\]<|im_end|>
