   \]

Thus, the function \( f \) is:
\[
f(x) = \frac{x}{f(y)}, \quad f(y) = \frac{y}{f(x)}
\]

Therefore, the solution is:
\[
\boxed{\frac{x}{f(y)}} \quad \text{and} \quad \frac{y}{f(x)}
\]<|im_end|>
