\[ \frac{A}{(10 + 10)} = \frac{7}{11} \]
\[ \frac{A}{20} = \frac{7}{11} \]

Solve for \( A \):
\[ A = 20 \times \frac{7}{11} \]
\[ A = \frac{140}{11} \]
\[ A = 13.58 \text{ (rounded to two decimal places)} \]

So, **Allen's age after 10 years will be approximately 13.58 years**.
