\frac{(x-1)(2-x)}{a(b+1)} &< 0 \\
(x-1)(2-x) &< ab(a+b+1)
\end{align*}
\]

**Solve for \( b \):**
\[ 
b(a+b+1) &< x-1 \\
b(a+b+1) &> x-1
\]

For all \( x \in [1, 2] \):
\[ 
b(a+b+1) > x-1 \quad \forall x \in [1, 2]
