**Solution:**

Given:
\[ f(x) = \sin(\omega x + \varphi), \quad 0 \leq x \leq \frac{2\pi}{3}, \quad \text{and} \quad f^{-1}(x) = \cos(\frac{\pi}{6} - \varphi) \]

