   \[ 27^2 \cdot a_5 = -8 \]
   \[ 729 \cdot a_5 = -8 \]
   \[ a_5 = -\frac{8}{729} \]

3. **Calculate \( a_7 \)**:
   \[ a_7 = a_5 + (n-1)a_{7-1} \]
