   \[ a_7 = -\frac{8}{729} + 6 \]
   \[ a_7 = -\frac{8}{729} + \frac{312}{729} \]
   \[ a_7 = \frac{-8 + 312}{729} \]
   \[ a_7 = \frac{294}{729} \]

Thus, **\( a_7 = \frac{294}{729} \)**. 

**Answer:** \( a_7 = \frac{294}{729} \).
