\]

**Therefore**, the power series representation is:
\[ 
\boxed{\frac{2}{(1 - x)^3}} = \sum_{n=0}^{\infty} (-x^n) \left[ \frac{1}{(1 - x)^4} + \frac{(-1)(-1)}{(1 - x)^5} + \cdots \right}
