   - **Integration by Parts**: For each term involving \( \sin x^2 \cos x^2 \):
     \[
     \int \sin x^2 \cos x^2 \, dx = \frac{\sin x^2}{2} \left( \frac{d}{dx} \sin x^2 \right) - \frac{\cos x^2}{2} \left( \frac{d}{dx} \cos x^2 \right)
