   \[
   |S_n - C| \leq r
   \]
2. **Maximum Absolute Value**: We seek the largest \( C \) such that:
   \[
   |a_n - C| \leq r
   \]

Using the definition of the geometric series \( S_n = a_1 + a_2 + \cdots + a_n \):

