\[ r(a_n - C) \leq r \]

Therefore,
\[ |a_n - C| \leq r \quad \text{for all} \quad n \in \mathbb{N} \]

Hence, the largest \( C \) is:
\[ C = r \]

Thus, the solution is:
\[ C = r \]<|im_end|>
