   \[ \sigma(n) = \sum_{d|n} d = \sum_{d=1}^{\infty} d = \frac{n(n+1)}{2}. \]

2. **Limit Calculation**:
   - For large \( n \): \( \frac{n(n+1)}{2} \approx n(n+1) \)
