   \[ d(P_i, P_j) = |x_i - x_j| + |y_i - y_j| \]

2. **Maximization Condition**:
   Given \( \lambda = \frac{\max_{i \neq j} d(P_i, P_j)}{\min_{i \neq j} d(P_i, P_j)} \):
   \[
   \lambda = \frac{|d(P_1, P_2)| + |d(P_2, P_3)|}{\min(|d(P_1, P_2)|, |d(P_2, P_3)|)}
