   d(P_1, P_3) = 8 - 2 = 6
   \]
   \[
   d(P_2, P_3) = 6 - 2 = 4
   \]
   Finally, compute \( \lambda \):
   \[
   \lambda = \frac{8 + 6 + 4}{10} = \frac{18}{10} = 1.8
