\[a_1, \ldots, a_n, b_1, \ldots, b_n\]
and \(n+1\) is a positive integer.

The condition \(a_k = b_{k-1} + k\) states:
\[a_k = b_{k-1} + (k-1) = b_{k-1} + (n-1)\]

