  - \( a_4 \): \( 12284 \times 9 + 1 = 111966 \)
  - \( a_5 \): \( 111966 \times 11 + 1 = 1250006 \)

Each number from \( 1 \) to \( 1250006 \) satisfies the condition \( \text{LCM}(A_1, A_2) = 2015 \).

Hence, \( n = 37 \) is correct. 

**Answer:** \( n = 37 \)<|im_end|>
