1. **Define \( f_N(x) \)**:
   \[ f_N(x) = \sum_{n=0}^{N-1} \frac{N + 1/2 - n}{(N+1)(2n+1)} \sin\left(\frac{(2n+1)x}{2}\right). \]

2. **Express \( f_N(x) \) in terms of trigonometric functions**:  
