**Find:** **$\lim_{n \to \infty} \frac{a_n}{n^3}$**.

**Solution:**

To find the limit of the series:

\[ \lim_{n \to \infty} \frac{a_n}{n^3} = \lim_{n \to \infty} \frac{\sin\left( \frac{(2k-1)\pi}{2n} \right)}{\frac{n^3}{(2n)^3}} \]

Simplify inside the limit:

