     \]
   - This is a geometric series where \( \binom{n-1}{k} = \frac{n-k}{k} \):
     \[
     \sum_{i=0}^{n-1} \binom{n-1}{i} = \frac{n!}{1!(n-1)!} = \frac{(n-1)(n-2)\cdots (n)}{n} = \frac{n(n-1)}{2}
     \]

3. **Divide by \( \sum_{i=0}^{n-1} P(x_i = 0) \)**:
   \[
