Question: **Translation:**

Given \( k \geq 3 \) is a prime number, define the **graph \( K_k \)** with \( k \) vertices:
\[ E(K_k) = \{ (v_1, v_2, ..., v_k) | v_i \in V(K_k) \text{ and } i \leq j \leq k \} \]
**Define the **complexity function \(\Delta_k\)**:
\[ \Delta_k = \sum_{i=1}^{k} \left| A(i) - E(i) \right| \]

**Compute the Euler characteristic \(\hat{\chi}_k\) of \(\Delta_k\):**
\[ \hat{\chi}_k = \frac{1}{k} \sum_{i=1}^{k} \left( \sum_{j=i+1}^k \left| A(j) - A(i) \right| \right) \mod k \]

**Answer:** 
\[ \boxed{\hat{\chi}_k \equiv \frac{1}{k} \sum_{i=1}^{k} \left( \sum_{j=i+1}^k |A(j)-A(i)| \right) \mod k} \]
