     w^* = w^{-1} \equiv w \mod n.
     \]

4. **Trace Calculation**:
   - Using the definition of \( \text{trace}_{\text{mod}} \):
     \[
     \text{trace}_{\text{mod}} \left( \frac{\sigma_1}{\sigma_1^{-3}} \right) = \sum_{k=0}^{n-1} k \cdot \text{trace}_{\text{mod}} \left( \frac{\sigma_k}{\sigma_{k+1}^{-3}} \right).
     \]

5. **Apply Modulo Operation**:
   - Since \( \sigma_1^{-3} \) is a cyclic subgroup of \( S_n \), we have:
     \[
     \text{trace}_{\text{mod}} \left( \frac{\sigma_1}{\sigma_1^{-3}} \right) = \text{trace}_{\text{mod}} \left( \frac{\sigma_1}{\sigma_1^{-3}} \right) \cdot \text{trace}_{\text{mod}} \left( \frac{\sigma_1^{-3}}{\sigma_1^{-3}} \right).
     \]

