\[ \nu_2(x_i) \geq f(n) \]

Calculate:
\[ \lim_{n \to \infty} \frac{f(n)}{\log_2 n} \]

**Answer:**
\[ \boxed{\lim_{n \to \infty} \frac{f(n)}{\log_2 n}} = \infty. \]

